89d6c319907003b.m4a", "recited": null, "recitedText": null}, {"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "anti", "arabic": "اِجْتَبِي", "plain": "اِجْتَبِي", "quran": false, "notUsed": false, "spoken": "audio/3594cf64a16d95018301.m4a", "recited": null, "recitedText": null}, {"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "antuma", "arabic": "اِجْتَبِيَا", "plain": "اِجْتَبِيَا", "quran": false, "notUsed": false, "spoken": "audio/769f2f68ecf32ff0f03a.m4a", "recited": null, "recitedText": null}, {"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "antum", "arabic": "اِجْتَبُوا", "plain": "اِجْتَبُوا", "quran": false, "notUsed": false, "spoken": "audio/ddae8f81c162fcf5cd95.m4a", "recited": null, "recitedText": null}, {"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "antunna", "arabic": "اِجْتَبِينَ", "plain": "اِجْتَبِينَ", "quran": false, "notUsed": false, "spoken": "audio/9bf96942f4c41aeb380d.m4a", "recited": null, "recitedText": null}], "ayat": [{"ref": "68:50", "tense": "past", "category": {"tense": "past", "pronoun": "huwa", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/5321.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "But his Lord chose him and placed him among the righteous.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Fakat Rabbi onu seçti de iyilerden kıldı.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "تو اسے اس کے رب نے چن لیا اور اپنے قربِ خاص کے سزاواروں (حقداروں) میں کرلیا،", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Lalu Tuhannya memilihnya dan menjadikannya termasuk orang-orang yang saleh.", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "فَٱجْتَبَٰهُ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/9aff37fb53ea6cffce5b.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "pa ga je odabrao", "en": "so He chose him", "tr": "böylece onu seçti", "fr": "alors Il l'a choisi", "id": "maka Dia memilihnya", "ur": "پھر اس نے اسے چن لیا", "bn": "তখন তিনি তাকে মনোনীত করলেন", "fa": "پس او را برگزید"}}, {"text": "رَبُّهُۥ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "فَجَعَلَهُۥ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "مِنَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلصَّٰلِحِينَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "6:87", "tense": "past", "category": {"tense": "past", "pronoun": "nahnu", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/876.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "With some of their forefathers and their offspring and their brethren; and We chose them and guided them unto a straight path.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Babalarından, çocuklarından ve kardeşlerinden bazılarını da (üstün kıldık). Onları seçtik ve doğru yola ilettik.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "اور کچھ ان کے باپ دادا اور اولاد اور بھائیوں میں سے بعض کو اور ہم نے انہیں چن لیا اور سیدھی راہ دکھائی،", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Dan Kami lebihkan (pula) derajat sebahagian dari bapak-bapak mereka, keturunan dan saudara-saudara mereka. Dan Kami telah memilih mereka (untuk menjadi nabi-nabi dan rasul-rasul) dan Kami menunjuki mereka ke jalan yang lurus.", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "وَمِنْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ءَابَآئِهِمْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَذُرِّيَّٰتِهِمْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَإِخْوَٰنِهِمْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَٱجْتَبَيْنَٰهُمْ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/85adbf4450f837274b01.m4a", "gloss": {"en": "and we chose them", "bs": "i izabrali smo ih", "tr": "ve onları seçtik", "fr": "et nous les avons choisis", "id": "dan kami telah memilih mereka", "ur": "اور ہم نے انہیں چنا", "bn": "এবং আমরা তাদের বাছাই করেছি", "fa": "و آنان را برگزیدیم"}}, {"text": "وَهَدَيْنَٰهُمْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "إِ